tical abilities</strong> can turn the tide of battle against the endless hordes of <strong>HIVE killing machines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/4568cb9729f85d521ecdbdde295a4c31.webp?t=1773167276\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.poster.avif?t=1773167276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.webm?t=1773167276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.mp4?t=1773167276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a <strong>variety of hostile automatons</strong>, each with unique strengths and weaknesses. Clear swarms of <strong>detonating drones</strong> with grenades, or bring out the <strong>heavy guns</strong> to dismantle towering <strong>war machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control a wide range of war machines. From towering mechs to tanks and fast-moving vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a vast arsenal of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deploy powerful support abilities like artillery strikes, automated turrets, and combat drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy cover and alter the battlefield with fully destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle 