rrages and heavy tanks. Build your perfect loadout and dominate the battlefield your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/103105b539c7a91186ef6752b9b64bec.webp?t=1773167276\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.poster.avif?t=1773167276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.webm?t=1773167276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.mp4?t=1773167276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in devastating <strong>artillery strikes</strong>, deploy <strong>turrets</strong> to lock down choke points, and launch <strong>drones</strong> to harass enemy swarms. Well-timed <strong>tactical abilities</strong> can turn the tide of battle against the endless hordes of <strong>HIVE killing machines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/4568cb9729f85d521ecdbdde295a4c31.webp?t=1773167276\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.